{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-22","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：最小公倍数与素数与互素与比例","englishTitle":"The least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them are prime to one another.","book":7,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","contentId":"euclid-7-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"557f88c892e545ea66674b0b34694fcd7945aec55e3fd0f838132287119abd7b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-22.statement","euclid-7-22.construction.1","euclid-7-22.proof.1","euclid-7-22.construction.2","euclid-7-22.proof.2","euclid-7-22.proof.3","euclid-7-22.proof.4","euclid-7-22.proof.5","euclid-7-22.proof.6","euclid-7-22.conclusion","euclid-7-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ee51f81c85a0c97c4e5109c959fe4cb9fa0b297de1cdbf4fc148a63aeaac5a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与她们比相同的人最少是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1eaf7c829da6af86bb63b68cb37860f38e4c59ea756ddc26756d4a0934061462","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them; I say that A, B are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为与它们相同比例的最小人数;我说A,B就是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ff386251778b833e28cead041e338cf85fa5935e41a708a7b53f418d1ffdcf4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if they are not prime to one another, some number will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是互素, 某些数字将整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e9b1724538581873622fe93ddef328861e9199dd7b892bb100bd7a3a8af0de8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let some number measure them, and let it be C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们数到整除,然后C"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56cf48f4c5118b3f57521c89d304dc2bd875433e54c47e281ff13afb22bea837","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as C measures A, so many units let there be in D, and, as many times as C measures B, so many units let there be in E"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有 C 整除 A乘以多少倍这么多单位 D和,多达C 整除 B倍这么多单位 E"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0f685f95eb037232c01b4f4c4361875e3cac95dd4844cb79f4ab5df973219db","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since C measures A according to the units in D, therefore C by multiplying D has made A. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"根据D的单位,C 整除 A,因此,C乘以D, 使A。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"791bdcd51453ca234f3f37b2a1a2d0b0040c483ffacf10ef5a3834c4812d9a9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also C by multiplying E has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,C乘以E, 已经做了B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fabd3f3c281aa6c4af61726a9214633dcdf8aaabc8408f878aa48dd79514f19","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the number C by multiplying the two numbers D, E has made A, B; therefore, as D is to E, so is A to B; [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)] therefore D, E are in the same ratio with A, B, being less than they: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,乘以这两个数字D、E和A,D和E的比等于A和B的比;因此,D、E的比与A和B的比相同,B比A和B的比低于:这是不可能做到的；D 与 E 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。（相关点与线段：C） [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5edebaaeb854707be736f4c2884d4be0d7283adbffdb07a6b3dca72037dc8ab9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure the numbers A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,没有号码整除 A,B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"788ccb45adc5a1a2df78452b6e7a11d315d14abaff5d7b1ce3b447182bae62a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B是互素。 Q. E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-22.source","contentId":"euclid-7-22","revisionId":"euclid-7-22@raw-557f88c892e545ea","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db6c7bb2df5b587239f17f08d419ff490816ea331760cc89aea495e8ed7ff7ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.22/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-e